==Mauville City==
After passing through [[Meteor Falls]], turn eastward and follow [[Rusturf Tunnel]] back to [[Mauville City]]. If you don't have it already, it is a good idea to visit [[Rydel's Cycles]] and swap out the [[Mach Bike]] for the [[Acro Bike]]. The upcoming terrain is harsh, and while the Mach Bike can reach some areas, the Acro Bike allows you to fully explore the rough landscape without making multiple visits.

==Route 112 (South)==
[[Team Magma]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Team Aqua]]{{sup/3|S}} has taken [[Professor Cozmo]]'s Meteorite to [[Mt. Chimney]], and the only way to follow is by cable car. When you return to {{rt|112|Hoenn}}, you find that the two Grunts are no longer blocking the base station. Enter the building and speak to the attendant to ride the cable car to the summit.

==Mt. Chimney==
[[File:Mt Chimney RS.png|thumb|Mt. Chimney]]

[[Mt. Chimney]] is a massive volcano located in the heart of [[Hoenn]]'s largest landmass. Although their intentions are not yet clear, [[Team Magma]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Team Aqua]]{{sup/3|S}} is determined to use [[Professor Cozmo]]'s Meteorite here in the next stage of their campaign.

