===The Escape===
Defeated, [[Maxie]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Archie]]{{sup/3|S}} reluctantly gives up on his plans for [[Mt. Chimney]], but declares that his group will still prevail. He and his subordinates make their escape, and Archie{{sup/3|R}}/Maxie{{sup/3|S}} catches up to you a moment later. He thanks you for your help, and vows that his group will continue fighting against the other's destructive plans. After he leaves, examine the machine to retrieve the [[Meteorite]] for [[Professor Cozmo]].

==Jagged Pass==
[[File:Jagged Pass RS.png|thumb|Jagged Pass]]

[[Jagged Pass]] was formed as the result of an ancient volcanic eruption. When the lava cooled, it proved to be suitable as an alternate route to the summit. Southbound travel involves simply jumping down from one level to the next, but traveling northward over the rough terrain requires the [[Acro Bike]].

