==Lavaridge Town==
[[File:Lavaridge Town RS.png|thumb|Lavaridge Town]]

Nestled at the foot of [[Mt. Chimney]], [[Lavaridge Town]] is well-known throughout [[Hoenn]] for its hot springs, and is a popular destination for elderly people because of it. The [[Herb Shop]] offers bitter yet beneficial [[Herbal medicine|medicines]] for Pokémon. The [[Lavaridge Gym]], fourth in the [[Hoenn League]], stands in the southwest part of town.

