After the battle, Flannery awards you the {{badge|Heat}}, which ensures the obedience of all Pokémon up to level 50 and enables the use of {{m|Strength}} in the field. She also gives you {{TM|50|Overheat}} as a prize.

===Destination: Desert!===
Outside, {{ga|May}}/{{ga|Brendan}} is impressed with your victory over the [[Lavaridge Gym]]. Since you are clearly a capable Trainer, she/he hands you the [[Go-Goggles]], a piece of protective eyewear that allows the wearer to explore the desert of {{rt|111|Hoenn}} despite the raging sandstorm. The young Trainer then heads off to challenge your father, [[Norman]], at the [[Petalburg Gym]].



